{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213990/extras/3cad3d71f1d7015225b32c0064e77104.poster.avif?t=1764811436\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213990/extras/3cad3d71f1d7015225b32c0064e77104.webm?t=1764811436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213990/extras/3cad3d71f1d7015225b32c0064e77104.mp4?t=1764811436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EMBARK THE &quot;MY LAST 20&quot; MISSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE COMPANY</strong> urgently seeks brave astronauts to enlist on the &quot;My Last 20&quot; mission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your objective:</strong> extract as many Space Tokens as possible from the Chaos Zone and survive for a ONLY 20 seconds. <span class=\"bb_strike\">This mission posses life insurace in case of death.</span>\u00a0Are you that brave astronaut?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213990/extras/87d80a530591d4d7af0fff6ead4dc46f.poster.avif?t=1764811436\" width=800 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213990/extras/87d80a530591d4d7af0fff6ead4dc46f.webm?t=1764811436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213990/extras/87d80a530591d4d7af0fff6ead4dc46f.mp4?t=1764811436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEMODES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Chaos Zone </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In My Last 20\u2019s Missions, you\u2019ll face 20 seconds of pure arcade madness. Asteroids? Cows? Tentacles? Each chaos zone is different with it's own difficulty and only the fastest astronauts will make it out alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u267e\ufe0f Endless Arcade Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited survival time with power-ups and 3 shields to keep you going. Beat your best run and climb the leaderboards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Hardcore Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete absurd challenges like &quot;Cook 100 cows with a bomb!&quot; and win extra free rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Unique Skins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock weird and increible skins, you can play as a Double Cheese burger, as a Avocado and even as a Rubber Duck!!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO ARE YOU?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The identity of the person behind the helmet remains a mystery but one thing is certain: sanity is not a quality of you. You are the only one who enlisted willingly to this mission and survived at least twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213990/extras/82b789e8b4577792e2cbe57b4506c405.poster.avif?t=1764811436\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213990/extras/82b789e8b4577792e2cbe57b4506c405.webm?t=1764811436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213990/extras/82b789e8b4577792e2cbe57b4506c405.mp4?t=1764811436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INCREDIBLY HARD</strong>: Being able to complete the My Last 20 mission is not a easy task. 20 seconds sounds like a short time but have to avoid even <strong>cows</strong> makes it challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>QUICK GAMEPLAY:</strong>\u00a0Perfect for those who like to test their reflexes and having to react in matter of seconds to avoid being killed by a <strong>Space Tentacle</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAZY LOOKING GRAPHICS:</strong>\u00a0A combination of modern and retro pixel art graphics with unique and weird characters make a perfect combination for a real trip.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE CHALLENGES:</strong> Play the main missions, complete hard challenges or play endlessly without time limitations and score your best time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AMAZING MUSIC</strong>: A perfect blend of nostalgia and space feel all thanks to\u00a0<strong><u>Lukasz (X-Ray) Sychowicz</u> </strong>to his song<strong> <u>Zizibum</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"One Sec?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2213990/c4a2101a443903c4b6943fc2e1a3c78a2ca16c6d.jpg"},{"name":"5s....","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2213990/c4a2101a443903c4b6943fc2e1a3c78a2ca16c6d.jpg"},{"name":"5+5 = 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2213990/c4a2101a443903c4b6943fc2e1a3c78a2ca16c6d.jpg"},{"name":"15s not big deal!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2213990/c4a2101a443903c4b6943fc2e1a3c78a2ca16c6d.jpg"},{"name":"That was sooooo close!!!!!!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2213990/c4a2101a443903c4b6943fc2e1a3c78a2ca16c6d.jpg"},{"name":"Extractor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2213990/925e8a395f1bbe2ef49ef2e752c2e9cefa075006.jpg"},{"name":"Meteorix","path":"https://cd